<div class="mb-2 pb-2 border-b last:border-b-0 border-palette-neutral-border-weak" data-role="example" data-edition="neo4j-ee"><div class="ndl-code-block-container listing-block mb-1 min-h-0 w-full cursor-pointer pr-6" style="height:undefinedpx"><div class="n-flex n-flex-col n-h-full"><div class="ndl-code-content-container" style="height:100%"><div class="ndl-code-pseudo-element"></div><div class="ndl-highlight-wrapper" role="textbox" aria-label="code-snippet" tabindex="0"><pre style="color:rgb(var(--theme-palette-neutral-text-default));line-height:1;width:fit-content;border:0;padding:0 44px 0.75em 0.75em"><code class="n-code" style="white-space:pre"><span>DROP DATABASE \`database-name\` CASCADE ALIASES</span></code></pre></div><div class="ndl-code-pseudo-element"></div></div></div><div class="ndl-code-block-actions"><button aria-label="Copy to clipboard" class="ndl-icon-btn ndl-small ndl-clean" data-testid="ndl-action-button-0" title="Copy to clipboard" data-role="cypher-ref-copy-button"><div class="ndl-icon"><div class="relative"><div class="ndl-tooltip-content ndl-theme-light n-body-small !left-[initial] !right-[24px] !top-[-5px] hidden whitespace-nowrap ndl-tooltip-content-simple" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0" tabindex="-1" data-floating-ui-focusable="" id=":Re:" role="tooltip"><span class="n-body-medium">Copied to clipboard!</span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="ndl-icon-svg undefined"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 8.25V6a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 6v8.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 16.5h2.25m8.25-8.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 20.25h-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 8.25 18v-1.5m8.25-8.25h-6a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25v6"></path></svg></div></div></button></div></div>
<div class="paragraph description">
<p>Drop the database <code class="n-code"><span class="n-bg-palette-neutral-bg-default rounded-sm px-1">database-name</span></code> and any database aliases referencing the database.
This command can drop both standard and composite databases.
For standard databases, the database aliases that will be dropped are any local database aliases targeting the database.
For composite databases, the database aliases that will be dropped are any constituent database aliases belonging to the composite database.</p>
</div></div>
